MID_LGV_1KAI_c11_Aur_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c11_Aur_m01_001: I would like you to be here again on the morning of\n{SetColor=Gold}{DateTime=Month} {DateTime=Day}{SetColor=Default}.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c11_Aur_m01_002: I appreciate you doing this, Cai. Please make sure\nyou don't forget.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c11_Aur_m01_003: Everything that's been happening recently could be\nthe very trouble the progenitor god foretold.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c11_Aur_m01_004: Yet, if my mother and father had never met,\nI wouldn't exist...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c11_Aur_m01_005: And I wouldn't have been able to see my son grow\nup to be such a splendid young man.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c11_Aur_m01_006: I can hardly call my mother a fool for disobeying a\ncommand of the progenitor god.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c11_Aur_m01_007: Nor is it my place to demand my father explain\nhis actions.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c11_Aur_m01_008: We cannot change the past, so we must accept what\nhas come before.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c11_Aur_m01_009: It is our duty to strive together for a better future.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c11_Aur_m01_010: The threads of causality, fate, whatever you might\nchoose to call it, are a very complex thing.
MID_LGA_1KAI_c11_Aur_m01: <BLN>Make certain you don't forget...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c11_Aur_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c11_Aur_m02_001: I'm glad you remembered! I believe I am ready to go.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c11_Aur_m02_002: Are you ready too, Cai? I'll follow your lead.
MID_LGA_1KAI_c11_Aur_m02: <BLN>I'm glad you remembered!
MID_LGV_1KAI_c11_Hur_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c11_Hur_m01_001: Y-Your Majesty! Cai, what in the world?! I can't\nbegin to understand what's going on here.
MID_LGA_1KAI_c11_Hur_m01: <BLN>What?!
MID_LGV_1KAI_c11_Tia_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c11_Tia_m01_001: I've hunted for a copy of The Rise of the White-\nManed Demon for ages. I finally found a copy!
MID_LGV_1KAI_c11_Tia_m01_002: I hear it's an amazing read. Maybe even one of the\nmasterpieces in the history of Dagdan literature.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c11_Tia_m01_003: I read a little before bed and everything I heard is\ntrue! I only stopped when I noticed the sunrise.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c11_Tia_m01_004: Since I've been up reading all night, my eyes are\nprobably as red as yours. Hehe.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c11_Tia_m01_005: But, yeah, I can really understand how this book got\nso incredibly popular.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c11_Tia_m01_006: The writer is so, so talented. And the main\ncharacter's life is very dramatic.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c11_Tia_m01_007: I've started to wonder if the main character is based\non Bertrand.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c11_Tia_m01_008: And, if he is, how much of it is embellishment and\nhow much of it is real?
MID_LGA_1KAI_c11_Tia_m01: <BLN>I finally found it!
MID_LGV_1KAI_c11_Pet_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c11_Pet_m01_001: Your mom's really excited to leave the temple.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c11_Pet_m01_002: Seeing her like that kinda makes me think that, even\nthough we call them gods...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c11_Pet_m01_003: they really aren't all that different from the rest of us.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c11_Pet_m01_004: I hope you're being careful not to let Centurio find\nout about this trip.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c11_Pet_m01_005: He'd definitely stop it from happening if he knew.\nI don't think that guy has ever had fun.
MID_LGA_1KAI_c11_Pet_m01: <BLN>She looks so excited...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c11_Hur_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c11_Hur_m02_001: Aurora's seemed more cheerful than usual lately.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c11_Hur_m02_002: For a while there it sort of felt like she'd given up.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c11_Hur_m02_003: However old she is, Aurora still looks like a\nyoung woman...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c11_Hur_m02_004: so it's good to see her moving in a better direction.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c11_Hur_m02_005: Centurio would be so upset if he found out, but that's\njust more reason to make her outing a fun one.
MID_LGA_1KAI_c11_Hur_m02: <BLN>Maybe I'm imagining it, but...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c11_Cen_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c11_Cen_m01_001: It has been good to see Aurora's spirits more elevated\nof late.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c11_Cen_m01_002: I believe this is wholly thanks to you, Cai. I am\ntruly grateful.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c11_Cen_m01_003: Perhaps, if she's in a good enough mood, I can get\nher to review the letters that have accumulated...
MID_LGA_1KAI_c11_Cen_m01: <BLN>I am truly grateful.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c11_Cas_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c11_Cas_m01_001: You won your match with the queen of Saramis!
MID_LGV_1KAI_c11_Cas_m01_002: Everybody in this hole has been talking about it.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c11_Cas_m01_003: If you keep it up, you'll be competing against my\nneighbor Bertrand in the final.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c11_Cas_m01_004: You know, it's surprising how comfortable a dungeon\ncell can be once you get used to it.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c11_Cas_m01_005: I've got all the amenities you could hope for.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c11_Cas_m01_006: My good buddy Gabriel, he's got a real eye for detail\nwhen it comes to creature comforts.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c11_Cas_m01_007: He might not seem like a great guy, but I think\ndeep inside he's probably got a good heart.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c11_Cas_m01_008: Though, from what I've heard, he's known to get\na bit annoying about money...
MID_LGA_1KAI_c11_Cas_m01: <BLN>I heard all about it!
MID_LGV_1KAI_c11_Cen_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c11_Cen_m02_001: You look like you're after more tales about\nthe old days.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c11_Cen_m02_002: OK then, where should I begin?
MID_LGV_1KAI_c11_Cen_m02_003: Eventually, Windstorm's outbursts calmed a bit...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c11_Cen_m02_004: Looking back, I think that change began after his\nfirst meeting Aurora.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c11_Cen_m02_005: Although, at the time, I was unaware of such\na meeting.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c11_Cen_m02_006: When I spoke to Estie recently, she told me she knew\nabout it.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c11_Cen_m02_007: She admitted that she'd even aided in Aurora and\nCastor keeping their relationship secret.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c11_Cen_m02_008: Given Estie's position in the temple, such behavior\nwas absolutely inexcusable...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c11_Cen_m02_010: 
MID_LGV_1KAI_c11_Cen_m02_009: I've just realized you have someone unfamiliar with\nyou today. A new friend, perhaps?
MID_LGA_1KAI_c11_Cen_m02: <BLN>Here for some more stories?
MID_LGV_1KAI_c11_Gab_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c11_Gab_m01_001: Even when you're my age, the world keeps serving\nup surprises.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c11_Gab_m01_002: But I guess that's the fun. You wanna hang in there\nand see what'll happen.
MID_LGA_1KAI_c11_Gab_m01: <BLN>Wild.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c11_Gab_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c11_Gab_m02_001: Counting on you, Bertrand. And Cai too!
MID_LGV_1KAI_c11_Gab_m02_002: Give them what for. Teach that gang of losers to shut\ntheir punk mouths.
MID_LGA_1KAI_c11_Gab_m02: <BLN>You show 'em!